      "text": "Day 7 · Canyoning in a jungle canyon full of tropical waterfalls: experienced guides fit your safety harness and help you rappel down a series of more than eight waterfalls, each bigger than the last, ending with a huge three-stage waterfall of about 64 metres. In the afternoon, after a briefing on driving and safety, an ATV ride around Arenal: La Fortuna Waterfall, the plantations of Jauri and La Guaria, and a snack by the Arenal River. Overnight at Arenal Paraíso Resort & Spa. (B, L)",
