      "sourceTextSha256": "84514704c37f0b2710441708e1935a38859d079bb030bf42c57c7322613e3078",
      "text": "Day 8 · Transfer to Monteverde around Lake Arenal, with magnificent views of the volcano. On the way, visit Viento Fresco, a private farm with five majestic waterfalls in the forest, and enjoy an hour’s walk with views of the Gulf of Nicoya, Cerro San José and Cerro Pelado. After lunch, continue to Monteverde. In the afternoon, the Monteverde bungee: the jump is made from a cable car at a height of 143 metres, billed as the highest in Central America. Overnight at Hotel Montaña Monteverde. (B, L)",
